  "details": "I'd say that I like the new nameplates and the Friends UI, but I'd like to give a few suggestions.\n\nIt would be nice if we could have the yellow names back and It's kind of hard to find people in an instance by only looking at the borders. Maybe the background could also have a slight yellow tint instead of being completely black.\n\nAs for the Friends quick tab menu, I don't know if it's just me, but I'm having a little trouble reading it. The background blends in with the rest of the UI, and sometimes I end up scrolling past or clicking on the wrong person. It would be nice to have a subtle outline or some separation between.",
